#### [MODIFY] [waist_belt_workaround.ino](file:///c:/Users/vaish/Downloads/SilverCare-main%20%281%29/SilverCare_SamaSocial/ESP32_codes/waist_belt_workaround.ino)
- **TinyML Engine Setup**: Implement `setupTinyML()` to initialize tensor arenas and model weights during boot.
- **On-Device Inference**: Implement `getTinyMLPrediction()` to process real-time IMU samples ($accelX, accelY, accelZ, gyroX, gyroY, gyroZ$) and vitals ($heartRate, SpO2, temp$), running inference directly on the ESP32 chip in 15–20 ms.
- **Dual-Layer Fall Trigger**: Use TinyML predictions to trigger alert workflows (`FALL`, `PREFALL`, `SUDDEN_MOVEMENT`, `NORMAL`) locally without requiring cloud HTTP connectivity.

